From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:14:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: gpu: mali-valhall-csf: Add Tensor G4

Describe the Tensor G4 Mali-G715 integration with its SoC-specific
compatible and the common Valhall CSF fallback. The SoC compatible lets
Panthor select the integration-specific cache hash data.

Google's GPL android-gs-tegu-6.1-android16 manifest uses the zuma GPU
node from zumapro. Its l2-hash-values are 0x0036db6d, 0x005b6db6 and 0.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zuma/+/42395e8adcb880aa336f0da6bb2a19ed53929c40/dts/zuma-gpu.dtsi
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/arm,mali-valhall-csf.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/arm,mali-valhall-csf.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/arm,mali-valhall-csf.yaml
index 1d25eeefc..e1951820a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/arm,mali-valhall-csf.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/arm,mali-valhall-csf.yaml
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - google,gs201-mali         # G710
+              - google,zumapro-mali       # G715 family
               - mediatek,mt8196-mali
               - nxp,imx95-mali            # G310
               - rockchip,rk3588-mali
